# logos.def - builtin logo table, input to tools/gen_logos.py.
#
# file | names (first is canonical) | colours for $1..$9 | key colour | title colour
# Colours are SGR parameters (31 red, 34 blue, 90 grey, 1;34 bold blue, ...).
# linux.txt is fastfetch's (MIT, see NOTICE), with its upstream colours.
openvms.txt       | OpenVMS,VMS             | 31,34     | 34 | 31
openvms_small.txt | OpenVMS_small,VMS_small | 34        | 34 | 31
linux.txt         | Linux,linux-generic     | 37,90,33  | 39 | 33
